  "scope": "The even convex matter measure obeys a full-interacting quadratic-source covariance bound at every nonnegative coupling and finite species. Derivative tensor sources have a uniform fixed-proper-cutoff bound. A positive massless pole with nonzero fixed residue cannot be identified with these bounded-normalization composites. This is not a no-go theorem for every emergent graviton, a proof of momentum differentiability, or a construction of a physical metric propagator. Einstein gravity, fixed-species curvature control, and TOE remain unproved. No Lean theorem."
}
